  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0: version alignment with EasyImageSharp 1.1.0. No public API of this package changed and no model contract, checksum or download behaviour changed; the package is rebuilt against the 1.1.0 core, which adds animated PNG encode/decode, BigTIFF decoding and a faster net8.0 PNG path. See CHANGELOG.md.",
